  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas Mutare - EC Urban Livelihoods Protection and Promotion Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the programme is to prevent destitution and protect and promote the livelihoods of the poorest and most vulnerable. The project purpose is to Improve quality of life, livelihood security and reduce water borne diseases for at least 1000 poor and vulnerable urban households in Nyanga peri urban. This is to be achieved through a number of interventions including market gardening,community HBC, cash transfers as well education support for OVCs. The programme also focuses on provision of clean and safe water and sanitation for communtites in the selected wards of peri urban Nyanga as well as provision of micro grants for small enterprises.</narrative>
  </description>
